\frametitle{Disposable generated artifacts and output inventory}
\breaktt{output/data/skilltree\_project.json}, the import-ready SkillTree
project. \breaktt{scripts/z\_generate\_manuscript\_variables.py} is the
parent-template render hook: it runs the kernel/provenance gate and
writes resolved manuscript copies under \breaktt{output/manuscript/}
before PDF, HTML, slide, DOCX, or EPUB rendering.
